{"unit_id":"President-H__dsh-balance-view#card-zh","repo":"President-H/dsh-balance-view","commit":"3983f1319005ac75973ea0b5732947383e227fb7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-view 是一个供 DSH 使用的 DeepSeek 账号余额查看插件。它接入宿主的 webServer 和 deepseekAccount 服务，启动时读取一次余额，之后每两分钟刷新并保存到本地 JSON 缓存。接口提供当前缓存，也可通过 refresh 参数触发立即更新。返回内容包含余额合计、充值与赠金分类、币种、钱包信息及检查时间；没有账号服务、未登录或暂无钱包时也会返回状态信息。适合希望让脚本、其他插件或机器人读取余额的 DSH 用户，需要已登录 DeepSeek 账号及宿主账号服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:73-117","lib/index.js:124-137"]}
{"unit_id":"President-H__dsh-balance-view#card-en","repo":"President-H/dsh-balance-view","commit":"3983f1319005ac75973ea0b5732947383e227fb7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-balance-view adds a read-only balance endpoint to DSH using the host account service. It fetches balances at startup and every two minutes, then saves totals and wallet details as JSON. Requests can trigger an immediate refresh. It requires a signed-in DeepSeek account supported by the host.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:73-117","lib/index.js:124-137"]}
