{"unit_id":"President-H__dsh-balance-view#feature-1","repo":"President-H/dsh-balance-view","commit":"3983f1319005ac75973ea0b5732947383e227fb7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance-view 的功能「定时缓存」：启动时获取一次余额，之后每两分钟更新，并写入 DSH_HOME 下的 JSON 文件；未设置时使用默认 ~/.dsh 路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:115-118"]}
